  "about": "What the SDKs need about each operation that the OpenAPI document does not say. Keyed by operationId; scripts/coverage.mjs fails when an operation of the contract has no entry here, or an entry names no operation.",
  "fields": {
    "retry": "read: retried with backoff and re-signed on every attempt (GET, and the POSTs that change nothing: validateAddress, estimateTransactionFeeByAssetId, validateUtxoTransfer). write: never re-signed with a new nonce once it may have reached the gateway (see test-vectors/retry-v1.json).",
    "cursorField": "cursor-paged lists: the item field whose value of the last item on a page is sent as startingAfter for the next page. null while it is not known (getAddressBalance: the docs say only 'ID of the last item').",
    "paging": "offset: offset-paged (limit, offset, total), only listApiKeySigningKeys."
  },
